  "서버 Paper 실행 중": ["서버 Paper 실행 중","Server Paper run in progress","サーバーで Paper 実行中","服务器 Paper 执行中","伺服器 Paper 執行中","Ejecución Paper del servidor en curso","Exécution Paper du serveur en cours"],
